"async\" width=\"790\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS7.jpg.webp\" class=\"attachment-full\" alt=\"patient satisfaction survey #7\" title=\"PS7\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS7.jpg.webp 790w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS7-660x855.jpg.webp 660w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS7-231x300.jpg.webp 231w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS7-768x996.jpg.webp 768w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS7-300x389.jpg.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 790px) 100vw, 790px\"></a></div></div><div class=\"vc_item\"><div class=\"vc_inner\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS2-802x1024.jpg.webp\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[rel-55000-2916139783]\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"802\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS2.jpg.webp\" class=\"attachment-full\" alt=\"Patient satisfaction survey #2\" title=\"PS2\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS2.jpg.webp 802w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS2-660x843.jpg.webp 660w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS2-235x300.jpg.webp 235w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS2-768x980.jpg.webp 768w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS2-300x383.jpg.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 802px) 100vw, 802px\"></a></div></div><div class=\"vc_item\"><div class=\"vc_inner\"><a class=\"\" href=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS1-793x1024.jpg.webp\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[rel-55000-2916139783]\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"793\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS1.jpg.webp\" class=\"attachment-full\" alt=\"Patient satisfaction survey #1\" title=\"PS1\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS1.jpg.webp 793w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS1-660x852.jpg.webp 660w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS1-232x300.jpg.webp 232w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS1-768x991.jpg.webp 768w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2020/01/PS1-300x387.jpg.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 793px) 100vw, 793px\"></a></div></div></div></div></div><a class=\"vc_left vc_carousel-control\" href=\"#vc_images-carousel-1-1779385150\" data-slide=\"prev\"><span class=\"icon-prev\"></span></a><a class=\"vc_right vc_carousel-control\" href=\"#vc_images-carousel-1-1779385150\" data-slide=\"next\"><span class=\"icon-next\"></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
  "bodyMarkdown": "# Our patients rate us highly!\n\nSometimes when you see a bunch of 5 star reviews you think to yourself “are these real or fake?”  Chances are, if there are only 5 star reviews and no 1 star reviews they probably are!  At JourneyLite, we pride ourselves in our top-notch patient care and regularly receive glowing, old-fashioned hand-written patient satisfaction surveys from our patients.  We have de-identified these and posted our Q4 2019 surveys just to show how our patients feel about our experienced and caring team.\n\n## Q4 Patient Satisfaction Surveys\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS8.jpg.webp.webp \"PS8\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS8-792x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS9.jpg.webp.webp \"PS9\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS9-792x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS3.jpg.webp.webp \"PS3\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS3-791x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS4.jpg.webp.webp \"PS4\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS4-794x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS5.jpg.webp.webp \"PS5\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS5-786x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS6.jpg.webp.webp \"PS6\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS6-788x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS7.jpg.webp.webp \"PS7\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS7-790x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS2.jpg.webp.webp \"PS2\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS2-802x1024.jpg.webp)\n\n[!(/legacy-blog/q4-2019-satisfaction-surveys__PS1.jpg.webp.webp \"PS1\")](https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/PS1-793x1024.jpg.webp)",
